<h1>Release notes</h1>
<p>This release makes the <strong>parser</strong> faster and the <em>errors</em> clearer. It also fixes <code>a &lt; b</code> in templates; see <a href="https://example.org/guide?a=1&amp;b=2">the guide</a>.</p>
<h2>What changed</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Lists of <strong>bold</strong> and <em>slanted</em> items</li>
  <li>A literal <code>**</code> stays as written</li>
  <li>An unclosed * star stays too</li>
</ul>
<ol>
  <li>Download the archive</li>
  <li>Run <code>make install</code></li>
  <li>Done</li>
</ol>
<blockquote>
<p>Upgrading is safe. Keep a <strong>backup</strong> all the same.</p>
</blockquote>
<pre><code class="language-sh">tar xf release.tar.gz
./configure --prefix=&quot;$HOME/.local&quot; &amp;&amp; make</code></pre>
<hr>
<p>Questions go to &lt;support@example.org&gt; &amp; the forum.</p>
